WEBVTT

01:30.950 --> 01:34.990
[Legend of the Magnate]

01:35.050 --> 01:37.960
[Episode 39]

01:38.710 --> 01:39.710
Cut the nonsense.

01:41.310 --> 01:42.039
Mr. Richard

01:42.039 --> 01:42.920
needs to discuss

01:42.920 --> 01:44.710
the specific details of the cooperation
with you.

01:44.710 --> 01:46.000
You need to send someone out

01:46.000 --> 01:47.800
to sign on behalf of Liangjiang.

01:47.840 --> 01:48.700
I assure you

01:49.070 --> 01:50.120
it'll be quick

01:51.120 --> 01:53.050
and won't take up much of your time.

01:53.200 --> 01:54.630
You little brat.

01:55.280 --> 01:58.410
When you bite someone,
it goes straight to the bone, huh?

02:00.400 --> 02:01.130
Gu Pingyuan.

02:01.590 --> 02:02.310
Yes, Your Excellency.

02:02.310 --> 02:04.680
Since things cannot be undone now,

02:04.920 --> 02:05.510
I now grant you full authority

02:05.510 --> 02:07.640
to act on behalf of
the Liangjiang Viceroy's Office

02:07.640 --> 02:09.300
in all external negotiations

02:09.400 --> 02:11.240
as well as financial and grain matters.

02:11.240 --> 02:13.150
All the manpower and resources
of Liangjiang

02:13.150 --> 02:14.350
are at your disposal,

02:14.470 --> 02:16.030
and all officials of Liangjiang

02:16.030 --> 02:17.829
are ready to follow your orders.

02:18.000 --> 02:18.840
You handle it!

02:18.980 --> 02:21.960
[Righteous and Diligent]

02:37.680 --> 02:39.120
We need to confirm

02:39.120 --> 02:40.680
your qualifications.

02:40.700 --> 02:41.520
We need to confirm

02:41.520 --> 02:42.780
your qualifications.

02:43.610 --> 02:44.680
What qualifications?

02:44.680 --> 02:46.000
What qualifications?

02:48.630 --> 02:49.360
We've been accustomed to

02:49.360 --> 02:51.770
dealing with the Qing Dynasty's officials,

02:51.770 --> 02:54.570
the ones with peacock feathers
behind their hats.

02:54.630 --> 02:55.960
I'd like to ask

02:56.190 --> 02:57.240
if Xianghe Trade House

02:57.240 --> 02:59.360
is a government institution
of your country?

02:59.360 --> 03:00.740
If not,

03:00.960 --> 03:01.840
and if

03:01.840 --> 03:02.750
what we are negotiating now

03:02.750 --> 03:04.470
is purely a commercial matter,

03:04.470 --> 03:06.080
then what right do they have

03:06.080 --> 03:07.920
to demand that
our imperial court officials

03:07.920 --> 03:09.100
attend?

03:13.960 --> 03:15.240
Do you have the authority
to sign a contract

03:15.240 --> 03:16.640
on behalf of Liangjiang?

03:17.190 --> 03:17.790
Of course.

03:18.250 --> 03:20.050
I believe that before I arrived,

03:20.160 --> 03:22.360
the official documents
from the Liangjiang Viceroy's Office

03:22.360 --> 03:23.680
had already been delivered to you.

03:23.680 --> 03:24.430
Alright.

03:25.310 --> 03:28.030
Chinese people are not that trustworthy.

03:31.280 --> 03:34.079
He said Chinese people
are not trustworthy.

03:38.840 --> 03:40.360
But our country would never

03:40.360 --> 03:42.440
go to war to protect opium.

03:43.030 --> 03:45.829
That's the difference
between our two countries.

04:05.470 --> 04:07.560
The title deeds for
all the salt fields and salt shops

04:07.560 --> 04:08.360
are in order.

04:09.460 --> 04:10.190
What's next?

04:11.310 --> 04:13.950
These title deeds for land are effective.

04:14.150 --> 04:14.960
And then?

04:18.680 --> 04:20.510
He said he wants to acquire

04:20.560 --> 04:21.750
all the shares of

04:21.750 --> 04:22.830
our Lianghuai salt industry.

04:22.830 --> 04:24.430
Is there a problem with that?

04:24.510 --> 04:27.390
The salt industry has always been
a state monopoly under the imperial court.

04:27.390 --> 04:28.580
In your country,

04:29.040 --> 04:30.370
do they allow merchants

04:30.510 --> 04:32.630
to sell salt freely?

04:37.150 --> 04:38.370
[Elements of International Law]

04:37.480 --> 04:38.750
The Elements of International Law.

04:38.750 --> 04:40.070
I specifically had someone

04:40.070 --> 04:42.470
translate your country's commercial law.

04:42.600 --> 04:44.010
According to your law,

04:44.360 --> 04:45.270
for any industry that is

04:45.270 --> 04:47.070
exclusively operated and sold
by the government,

04:47.070 --> 04:47.800
the government naturally

04:47.800 --> 04:49.690
holds a certain share.

04:49.710 --> 04:50.870
If he has any disagreement

04:50.870 --> 04:51.920
on this point,

04:52.190 --> 04:52.950
we can resolve it

04:52.950 --> 04:54.550
through official channels.

04:58.750 --> 05:00.390
Isn't that ironic?

05:00.830 --> 05:01.620
He said

05:02.000 --> 05:04.680
isn't that ironic,
talking about commercial laws

05:04.680 --> 05:06.000
in our Qing Dynasty?

05:06.030 --> 05:08.160
Then let's take this to their country.

05:08.270 --> 05:10.360
I believe if we pursue this lawsuit,

05:10.460 --> 05:11.090
spending 4 or 5 years on it

05:11.090 --> 05:12.420
shouldn't be a problem.

05:12.650 --> 05:14.240
It's just I'm afraid that by that time,

05:14.240 --> 05:15.360
whether Mr. Richard

05:15.360 --> 05:16.360
will still hold his current position

05:16.360 --> 05:18.360
at Xianghe Trade House

05:18.950 --> 05:20.490
is hard to say.

05:23.160 --> 05:25.120
By that time, if Li Qin's account

05:25.190 --> 05:26.360
cannot be settled for too long

05:26.360 --> 05:27.620
and becomes a bad debt,

05:27.800 --> 05:29.730
I'll feel concerned on his behalf.

05:42.950 --> 05:43.790
He said

05:43.920 --> 05:46.360
our Xianghe Trade House believes

05:46.600 --> 05:48.070
that we have the right to claim

05:48.070 --> 05:49.730
ownership of our collateral.

05:49.770 --> 05:51.900
There's no dispute about that, right?

05:52.070 --> 05:52.870
No.

05:53.510 --> 05:54.800
But I want to remind him

05:54.820 --> 05:56.510
from a merchant's perspective

05:56.510 --> 05:57.310
that all business transactions

05:57.310 --> 05:59.030
should be based on freedom

05:59.510 --> 06:01.240
and voluntary participation.

06:01.360 --> 06:02.070
If he enters

06:02.070 --> 06:03.240
the Qing Dynasty's commercial market

06:03.240 --> 06:04.600
with this attitude,

06:05.310 --> 06:07.040
it would be a complete mistake.

06:07.560 --> 06:08.600
The title deeds

06:09.040 --> 06:10.520
he currently holds for those salt fields—

06:10.520 --> 06:11.650
I can guarantee

06:11.950 --> 06:13.680
that once he sees them, he'll realize

06:13.680 --> 06:14.600
they're nothing

06:14.600 --> 06:15.460
but flat rocks.

06:15.510 --> 06:17.570
No one will be willing to work for him,

06:17.950 --> 06:19.920
and the so-called deeds
to those salt shops

06:19.920 --> 06:21.780
are nothing but empty buildings.

06:21.800 --> 06:24.010
No one will be willing to
run a store for him,

06:24.010 --> 06:24.770
and he'll

06:26.050 --> 06:27.510
gain absolutely nothing.

06:30.560 --> 06:31.950
Oh, I have many ways

06:31.950 --> 06:34.040
to make my collateral profitable.

06:34.480 --> 06:35.120
He said

06:35.270 --> 06:36.659
they have many ways

06:36.800 --> 06:37.310
to make

06:37.310 --> 06:39.040
their collateral profitable.

06:39.240 --> 06:41.040
They can sell it to other countries

06:41.040 --> 06:41.560
or

06:42.159 --> 06:43.820
sell it to our imperial court.

06:44.560 --> 06:45.270
In short,

06:45.680 --> 06:46.630
in this world,

06:47.870 --> 06:50.120
we Chinese care too much about dignity.

06:51.040 --> 06:52.700
They don't believe we can

06:52.730 --> 06:54.240
achieve our business goals

06:54.240 --> 06:56.120
through patience and delay.

06:58.710 --> 06:59.750
If there's a cannon

06:59.750 --> 07:01.150
pointing at my doorstep,

07:01.430 --> 07:03.140
then whatever means I use

07:03.510 --> 07:04.970
would be beyond reproach.

07:05.310 --> 07:07.510
If a cannon faces our home,

07:08.190 --> 07:09.510
I cannot be blamed

07:09.630 --> 07:10.750
for anything I do.

07:11.900 --> 07:14.030
Until the goal is achieved,

07:14.360 --> 07:17.360
the cannons shall not be withdrawn.

07:17.930 --> 07:19.460
Until the goal is achieved,

07:19.480 --> 07:21.480
the cannons shall not be withdrawn.

07:37.800 --> 07:39.159
But maybe

07:40.070 --> 07:41.390
we can

07:41.390 --> 07:43.360
continue our negotiations in one month.

07:43.360 --> 07:45.950
He said perhaps we can come again

07:46.040 --> 07:47.510
to continue our negotiations in one month.

07:47.510 --> 07:48.640
Because he knows

07:48.820 --> 07:50.620
the Emperor and Empress Dowager

07:50.680 --> 07:52.690
have set you a deadline.

07:53.240 --> 07:54.720
Maybe in one month,

07:55.070 --> 07:55.950
I shall be seeing

07:55.950 --> 07:57.480
your head on the city wall.

07:57.480 --> 07:59.159
Maybe in one month...

08:02.040 --> 08:03.240
He'll see

08:03.920 --> 08:05.380
your head on the city wall.

08:05.680 --> 08:06.360
Li Qin,

08:07.270 --> 08:08.720
how could you say such things?

08:08.720 --> 08:09.430
He's right.

08:10.970 --> 08:13.170
Perhaps we should both take a step back.

08:15.750 --> 08:17.390
If Li Qin wants to mortgage

08:17.390 --> 08:19.430
all the title deeds of
the salt fields and shops

08:19.430 --> 08:20.510
that he currently holds,

08:20.510 --> 08:22.040
I believe you're also aware

08:22.610 --> 08:24.880
that in principle, he's not qualified.

08:25.890 --> 08:28.140
To gain complete control,

08:28.390 --> 08:29.850
he has to wait a bit longer.

08:30.520 --> 08:31.530
We

08:31.670 --> 08:33.210
made a bet before,

08:34.030 --> 08:34.909
about which one would be more profitable,

08:34.909 --> 08:37.070
the Lianghuai Salt Industry Guild

08:37.320 --> 08:39.120
or his Li family.

08:40.440 --> 08:41.600
I remember that this bet

08:41.600 --> 08:43.059
has less than a month left,

08:43.400 --> 08:44.350
and its outcome

08:44.630 --> 08:47.490
will determine the ownership
of the salt industry.

08:49.130 --> 08:51.190
You're telling me

08:54.440 --> 08:57.080
that you wanna compete

08:57.080 --> 08:59.030
with an international trade company?

08:59.030 --> 08:59.760
Are you sure?

09:00.000 --> 09:00.600
Of course.

09:01.080 --> 09:02.050
I need to ensure

09:02.510 --> 09:04.110
that the account audit
is accurate and valid,

09:04.110 --> 09:05.510
that the competition is fair,

09:05.510 --> 09:08.040
and that the results
are mutually confirmed.

09:23.750 --> 09:25.250
I need a contract.

09:25.750 --> 09:27.670
We need a contract.

09:53.670 --> 09:55.330
Anything else you want to say?

09:58.590 --> 10:00.060
If I sign it now,

10:01.030 --> 10:01.870
someone will

10:01.870 --> 10:04.470
go to the capital
and raid your house tomorrow,

10:04.560 --> 10:05.960
and the mighty Li family

10:06.910 --> 10:07.940
will be gone.

10:12.860 --> 10:13.720
Mr. Gu.

10:14.360 --> 10:16.020
There's no need to remind him.

10:16.300 --> 10:17.720
If someone is determined

10:17.720 --> 10:18.580
to be a traitor,

10:19.240 --> 10:20.640
even gods can't save him.

10:29.500 --> 10:30.830
I don't want it anymore.

10:37.460 --> 10:40.470
[Contract Signatory: Gu Pingyuan]

10:40.550 --> 10:41.900
[Righteous and Diligent]

10:41.380 --> 10:43.040
The Viceroy is stepping down.

10:43.120 --> 10:45.120
The Emperor and Empress Dowager
are furious.

10:45.120 --> 10:47.050
The traitor issue is troublesome.

10:47.200 --> 10:47.790
Indeed.

10:54.090 --> 10:57.550
[Righteous and Diligent]

10:55.600 --> 10:56.600
Your Excellency.

10:56.840 --> 10:58.240
No need for formalities.

10:58.630 --> 10:59.240
Everyone,

10:59.670 --> 11:00.730
as you all know,

11:00.870 --> 11:02.030
the Xianghe Trade House

11:02.030 --> 11:04.550
is planning to meddle in
the Lianghuai salt industry.

11:04.550 --> 11:07.200
I've entrusted Mr. Gu

11:07.270 --> 11:09.720
with full authority over
Liangjiang's financial and grain affairs.

11:09.720 --> 11:12.050
His orders are my orders.

11:12.840 --> 11:14.900
This matter concerns our very lives,

11:15.090 --> 11:16.750
so everyone must be cautious.

11:17.840 --> 11:18.870
Yes, Your Excellency.

11:18.470 --> 11:18.990
[Clear Rivers and Ringing Shrines]

11:19.130 --> 11:24.670
[Righteous and Diligent]

11:21.000 --> 11:22.150
If anyone dares play dumb

11:22.150 --> 11:23.150
or collude with

11:23.210 --> 11:24.760
foreigners in private,

11:25.050 --> 11:26.980
I'll hold them fully accountable!

11:30.960 --> 11:31.510
Mr. Gu,

11:32.110 --> 11:33.770
please take the seat of honor.

11:35.030 --> 11:35.550
Please.

11:36.670 --> 11:37.200
Come on.

11:42.480 --> 11:43.410
Come on, please.

11:52.430 --> 11:53.270
[Clear Rivers and Ringing Shrines]

11:56.750 --> 11:57.490
Gentlemen,

11:58.440 --> 11:59.360
even if I don't say it,

11:59.360 --> 12:00.560
you're all well aware

12:01.080 --> 12:02.150
that the Lianghuai salt industry

12:02.150 --> 12:04.410
is the economic lifeline of Liangjiang.

12:04.410 --> 12:07.500
[Righteous and Diligent]

12:04.550 --> 12:06.000
No matter which merchant holds it,

12:06.000 --> 12:07.870
it's still under government supervision.

12:07.870 --> 12:08.630
But once it falls into

12:08.630 --> 12:09.720
the foreigners' hands,

12:09.720 --> 12:11.450
there will be serious trouble.

12:13.000 --> 12:14.120
Now that we've decided

12:14.120 --> 12:15.790
to wage a war against the foreigners,

12:15.790 --> 12:16.440
we must

12:16.440 --> 12:18.300
prepare for it with all our might.

12:19.220 --> 12:20.630
In the Liangjiang region,

12:20.630 --> 12:22.560
the most abundant product is silk.

12:23.320 --> 12:24.080
Now, I need you

12:24.080 --> 12:25.910
to collect raw silk in large quantities

12:25.910 --> 12:27.200
to encourage private production,

12:27.200 --> 12:29.660
especially high-quality silk embroidery.

12:29.790 --> 12:30.670
I know you already have

12:30.670 --> 12:31.720
a lot in stock,

12:32.000 --> 12:33.800
but I need even more.

12:33.660 --> 12:35.740
[Clear Rivers and Ringing Shrines]

12:34.000 --> 12:36.060
You must do your utmost to collect it.

12:38.270 --> 12:39.370
I'm counting on all of you.

12:39.370 --> 12:42.580
[Righteous and Diligent]

12:40.390 --> 12:41.200
I need you to compile

12:41.200 --> 12:42.400
an exact inventory of

12:42.620 --> 12:43.780
all the raw silk

12:43.960 --> 12:45.150
you can collect this year,

12:45.150 --> 12:46.000
including silk in stock

12:46.000 --> 12:47.360
and local specialties for me.

12:47.360 --> 12:48.690
The sooner, the better.

12:50.250 --> 12:52.080
The desks are all prepared for you.

12:52.080 --> 12:53.140
If you can't recall

12:53.200 --> 12:54.240
or don't know the numbers,

12:54.240 --> 12:56.240
quickly send someone back to check.

12:56.320 --> 12:58.650
Everything must be submitted to me today.

12:59.390 --> 13:00.270
Yes, Your Excellency.

13:00.270 --> 13:03.700
[Righteous and Diligent]

13:00.360 --> 13:01.020
Go on ahead.

13:03.770 --> 13:06.120
[Clear Rivers and Ringing Shrines]

13:11.910 --> 13:13.510
Get up. Let me sit for a while.

13:14.860 --> 13:16.410
It actually feels quite comfortable
sitting here.

13:16.410 --> 13:18.670
I have a stomachache seeing you sit here.

13:18.960 --> 13:19.390
Get up.

13:20.120 --> 13:21.150
But if you don't sit there,

13:21.150 --> 13:22.960
His Excellency will have a headache.

13:22.960 --> 13:24.200
His health just can't be good.

13:24.200 --> 13:25.150
Alright, shut up.

13:25.150 --> 13:25.750
Get up.

13:26.850 --> 13:28.580
Wait, I have a question for you.

13:28.960 --> 13:31.550
What do you need all that silk for?

13:34.600 --> 13:36.400
That's a secret I cannot reveal.

13:37.240 --> 13:37.960
I still have to meet

13:37.960 --> 13:39.080
some important guests.

13:39.080 --> 13:39.740
Gentlemen,

13:40.150 --> 13:41.150
please excuse me.

13:53.390 --> 13:54.390
Mr. Li.

13:55.750 --> 13:56.880
You look so relaxed.

13:59.440 --> 14:03.000
You won't let me lose to

14:03.150 --> 14:04.880
that Chinese fellow, will you?

14:06.960 --> 14:09.030
You have steamships.

14:10.390 --> 14:11.390
You can sell your goods

14:11.390 --> 14:13.320
all over the world.

14:14.960 --> 14:16.560
Can't the East India Company

14:18.120 --> 14:19.080
defeat

14:19.080 --> 14:21.010
the Liangjiang Viceroy's Office?

14:23.600 --> 14:25.220
Do you think

14:25.270 --> 14:27.000
this Chinese man surnamed Gu

14:28.320 --> 14:29.200
can beat me?

14:33.790 --> 14:35.510
He might be able to beat you,

14:37.600 --> 14:39.260
and he might be able to beat me,

14:40.750 --> 14:43.240
but he can never beat this ship.

14:51.580 --> 14:56.340
[Huizhou Prefecture]

14:59.030 --> 15:01.280
Our "Top Tea Under Heaven" is back!

15:02.750 --> 15:04.440
-Mr. Gu!
-Mr. Gu!

15:05.240 --> 15:06.510
We've been waiting for you, Mr. Gu!

15:06.510 --> 15:08.370
You've had a long journey, Mr. Gu.

15:16.600 --> 15:17.390
Old Master Hu.

15:17.390 --> 15:18.120
You're back.

15:18.480 --> 15:19.480
Please, this way.

15:33.200 --> 15:34.600
These are the accounts

15:34.870 --> 15:36.870
of our business with foreigners
over the years.

15:36.870 --> 15:38.440
Look through them carefully.

15:38.440 --> 15:40.670
We've heard

15:41.200 --> 15:43.270
that you're challenging the foreigners

15:43.270 --> 15:45.120
and you plan to beat them in business.

15:45.120 --> 15:47.360
Just tell us what you need.

15:47.720 --> 15:49.120
If money is needed, we'll provide money;

15:49.120 --> 15:51.390
if manpower is needed,
we'll provide manpower.

15:51.390 --> 15:52.720
That's right.

15:53.480 --> 15:54.510
-Yes.
-Everyone.

15:54.720 --> 15:56.840
I won't waste time with words of thanks.

15:56.840 --> 15:58.500
I need this year's spring tea.

15:58.840 --> 16:00.070
From now on,

16:00.150 --> 16:01.360
it cannot be sent to other tea shops,

16:01.360 --> 16:02.720
especially first-grade
and second-grade tea.

16:02.720 --> 16:03.390
Keep it all for me

16:03.390 --> 16:04.650
and wait for my orders.

16:05.360 --> 16:06.270
Okay.

16:06.840 --> 16:08.370
Everyone's agreed, right?

16:08.840 --> 16:09.960
If anyone can't make ends meet,

16:09.960 --> 16:10.690
come find me.

16:11.390 --> 16:13.790
Don't ruin our grand plan.

16:17.140 --> 16:20.360
[Pingyao, Shanxi]

16:27.360 --> 16:28.000
Mr. Li!

16:28.240 --> 16:30.100
I've been waiting for you all day.

16:36.570 --> 16:38.030
That ride has been so bumpy

16:38.390 --> 16:39.630
that my bones feel like
they're falling apart.

16:39.630 --> 16:41.090
Quick, get in and sit down.

16:43.140 --> 16:43.920
Alright.

16:44.480 --> 16:45.750
You know, after I said
I'd come pick you up,

16:45.750 --> 16:47.810
I saw this carriage outside,

16:48.870 --> 16:50.600
and I felt I had to give it a ride.

16:50.860 --> 16:51.960
Haven't driven one in decades,

16:51.960 --> 16:53.760
but I'm still quite steady at it.

16:55.600 --> 16:56.200
So,

16:56.600 --> 16:57.550
dare to ride with me?

16:57.550 --> 16:59.390
Sure. Just keep it steady.

16:59.720 --> 17:01.120
You're quite picky, huh?

17:13.920 --> 17:15.250
Remember Wang Tiangui?

17:16.339 --> 17:17.430
How could I forget?

17:18.030 --> 17:19.349
He had no children,

17:19.800 --> 17:20.599
and after he went missing,

17:20.599 --> 17:21.750
only a few creditors

17:21.790 --> 17:23.270
were looking for him every day.

17:23.270 --> 17:25.599
What about his draft banks and pawnshops?

17:26.440 --> 17:27.720
Only heaven knows.

17:28.550 --> 17:29.610
Only heaven knows?

17:31.720 --> 17:33.070
Do you know

17:33.070 --> 17:34.790
what the truth about wealth is?

17:34.790 --> 17:36.750
It belongs neither to you nor me.

17:37.450 --> 17:39.230
It circulates among people.

17:39.510 --> 17:41.110
Whoever keeps it longer

17:41.750 --> 17:43.030
is favored by heaven.

17:53.570 --> 17:58.240
[Pine and Bamboo Contain Charm]

17:55.270 --> 17:56.750
I thought you were

17:56.750 --> 17:58.750
doing some big business in Nanjing.

17:59.030 --> 18:00.690
Now that you're back, how come

18:00.830 --> 18:02.550
you're eating like
a starving ghost reincarnated?

18:02.550 --> 18:03.440
I don't know why,

18:03.440 --> 18:04.350
but as soon as I saw you guys,

18:04.350 --> 18:05.480
I got really hungry.

18:05.480 --> 18:06.240
I was too worried to eat

18:06.240 --> 18:07.700
back in Jinling, you know?

18:10.330 --> 18:11.990
You've eaten so many noodles—

18:12.550 --> 18:14.030
so when do you plan to tell me

18:14.030 --> 18:15.690
that Chang Yu'er's pregnant?

18:17.030 --> 18:17.510
Right.

18:18.200 --> 18:18.920
What do you mean "right"?

18:18.920 --> 18:19.720
Are you planning to wait

18:19.720 --> 18:20.640
until after the child is born

18:20.640 --> 18:22.040
to thank the matchmaker?

18:23.030 --> 18:24.200
Madam, I was wrong.

18:24.590 --> 18:25.600
I even told Yu'er

18:25.750 --> 18:26.720
that once the child is born,

18:26.720 --> 18:28.310
we'll have him recognize you
as Godmother.

18:28.310 --> 18:28.790
If it weren't for you

18:28.790 --> 18:29.920
giving me those few hints,

18:29.920 --> 18:30.480
who knows

18:30.480 --> 18:31.960
how long I would have remained confused?

18:31.960 --> 18:32.920
That's absolutely true.

18:32.920 --> 18:33.940
Of course it is.

18:34.270 --> 18:36.200
Otherwise, I wouldn't let you off.

18:36.960 --> 18:37.690
Come on, sit.

18:38.400 --> 18:38.960
But

18:39.240 --> 18:40.370
how did you find out?

18:41.700 --> 18:44.030
We sent someone to deliver some medicine.

18:44.160 --> 18:45.620
He doesn't know anything.

18:45.680 --> 18:46.830
Since your mother passed away,

18:46.830 --> 18:48.960
you've been having a hard time, right?

18:49.510 --> 18:50.040
Alright.

18:50.550 --> 18:51.000
Buddy,

18:51.680 --> 18:53.160
let's get down to business.

18:53.160 --> 18:54.820
What big deal have you brought?

18:54.820 --> 18:55.550
You have no idea

18:55.550 --> 18:56.720
how exhausted I've been
these past 10 days.

18:56.720 --> 18:57.400
First,

18:57.400 --> 18:58.880
I visited all the silk factories

18:58.880 --> 18:59.880
in the Huzhou and Jinling area.

18:59.880 --> 19:00.510
Then

19:00.640 --> 19:01.350
I went to visit

19:01.350 --> 19:03.030
the Anhui Tea Merchants' Association.

19:03.030 --> 19:04.360
After leaving here,

19:04.440 --> 19:07.030
I still have to go to Hangzhou
to meet with Wu Caishen.

19:07.030 --> 19:08.550
He's been in the silk business for years,

19:08.550 --> 19:10.160
so he must have plenty in stock.

19:10.160 --> 19:12.350
After that, I also need to
go to the capital

19:12.350 --> 19:15.110
and pay a visit to
the Office of General Management.

19:15.110 --> 19:15.750
Why?

19:16.800 --> 19:17.550
Recently,

19:17.720 --> 19:19.790
I've been studying
the "Elements of International Law."

19:19.790 --> 19:21.270
It states that

19:21.350 --> 19:23.080
trade is free in all countries.

19:23.310 --> 19:25.010
Our country's exports

19:25.080 --> 19:29.470
[Pine and Bamboo Contain Charm]

19:25.160 --> 19:26.560
to India fall mainly into

19:26.750 --> 19:28.750
4 categories:

19:28.750 --> 19:29.880
tea, silk, medicine, and porcelain.

19:29.880 --> 19:31.400
I don't know much about porcelain,

19:31.400 --> 19:33.350
but I have some connections
for the other three.

19:33.350 --> 19:35.200
I plan to follow my previous plan:

19:35.200 --> 19:37.400
I want to bypass the East India Company.

19:39.440 --> 19:40.310
You want to transport

19:40.310 --> 19:42.270
the goods directly to India?

19:43.650 --> 19:44.640
If possible,

19:44.640 --> 19:45.840
I want to go even further.

19:45.840 --> 19:47.680
All the way west across the Indian Ocean

19:47.680 --> 19:48.440
to sell to the British

19:48.440 --> 19:49.500
and Americans.

19:49.790 --> 19:50.830
Since they can come to our country,

19:50.830 --> 19:52.760
why can't we go to their countries?

19:53.960 --> 19:55.350
Come on, let's have a drink.

19:55.350 --> 19:56.810
That's a bit frightening.

19:57.400 --> 19:58.280
I'll drink too.

20:02.350 --> 20:04.150
I heard you have a 6-month bet

20:04.240 --> 20:05.350
with Xianghe Trade House

20:05.350 --> 20:07.310
over the salt field property rights.

20:07.310 --> 20:08.270
How could you still have time

20:08.270 --> 20:10.330
to deal with all these other matters?

20:10.350 --> 20:12.070
Madam, do you think I can win?

20:13.080 --> 20:13.950
You can't?

20:14.720 --> 20:16.110
Given the current situation,

20:16.110 --> 20:17.440
I definitely can't win.

20:17.860 --> 20:18.880
If you want your business to grow,

20:18.880 --> 20:19.960
the market has to be big.

20:19.960 --> 20:20.720
Our market

20:20.720 --> 20:22.680
is limited to 13 provinces,
7 in the south and 6 in the north.

20:22.680 --> 20:23.880
Except for the 5 salt-producing regions,

20:23.880 --> 20:24.830
in the remaining provinces,

20:24.830 --> 20:26.700
the scale and profits of salt shops

20:26.700 --> 20:28.160
are basically saturated.

20:29.070 --> 20:30.240
So where does Xianghe Trade House's profit

20:30.240 --> 20:31.630
come from?

20:31.960 --> 20:33.350
From hand to hand, basically.

20:33.350 --> 20:35.550
They sell directly to
the East India Company.

20:35.550 --> 20:37.480
They want to get capital into
the salt industry,

20:37.480 --> 20:39.830
and they're willing to spend more money
to do so.

20:39.830 --> 20:40.920
As for who the East India Company

20:40.920 --> 20:41.770
plans to sell to next—

20:41.770 --> 20:42.830
only heaven knows.

20:43.350 --> 20:44.950
But with their market scale,

20:45.160 --> 20:46.160
this amount of salt

20:46.160 --> 20:47.640
is still manageable for them.

20:47.640 --> 20:48.270
Buddy.

20:49.200 --> 20:50.030
You're trying to take on

20:50.030 --> 20:52.030
the East India Company by yourself—

20:52.510 --> 20:54.170
do you think that's possible?

20:55.350 --> 20:56.720
You're trying to use one man's power

20:56.720 --> 20:58.120
against a whole country.

20:58.180 --> 20:59.780
Your ambition is admirable,

20:59.920 --> 21:01.520
but it's simply impossible.

21:01.720 --> 21:03.920
You know that when I went abroad before,

21:03.960 --> 21:05.490
I also sold to local agents.

21:06.000 --> 21:07.510
The profit was indeed a bit higher.

21:07.510 --> 21:09.480
But since we still rely on
the foreigners' ships,

21:09.480 --> 21:11.510
opportunities to go abroad
still aren't frequent.

21:11.510 --> 21:12.480
If you want to establish

21:12.480 --> 21:14.540
your own business foundation there,

21:14.960 --> 21:17.250
even 10 or 20 years wouldn't be enough.

21:17.550 --> 21:19.010
I don't have 10 or 20 years.

21:19.230 --> 21:20.160
It can't be done.

21:20.830 --> 21:22.090
It's just impossible.

21:22.440 --> 21:24.300
Human capability has its limits.

21:25.350 --> 21:26.670
Besides, in this era,

21:26.920 --> 21:28.120
this kind of business

21:28.270 --> 21:29.960
can no longer be considered
ordinary commerce—

21:29.960 --> 21:32.690
it's more like a competition
between countries.

21:33.440 --> 21:35.170
You're being too unrealistic.

21:37.030 --> 21:38.370
The raw silk,

21:38.440 --> 21:38.970
tea,

21:39.270 --> 21:40.200
and other goods you bring in—

21:40.200 --> 21:41.920
how much capital do you need to tie up?

21:41.920 --> 21:43.240
The Qing Dynasty explicitly prohibits

21:43.240 --> 21:44.160
merchants from

21:44.180 --> 21:45.350
doing business abroad freely,

21:45.350 --> 21:45.750
right?

21:45.770 --> 21:47.770
You'd be breaking the imperial law.

21:48.090 --> 21:50.030
And you even want to charter
British merchant ships.

21:50.030 --> 21:51.360
Would customs approve?

21:51.450 --> 21:53.250
Would the merchant ships agree?

21:53.310 --> 21:54.170
As far as I know,

21:55.000 --> 21:56.270
the merchant ships in Shanghai

21:56.270 --> 21:58.670
are mostly owned by
the East India Company.

21:59.110 --> 22:00.170
And one last thing.

22:00.590 --> 22:01.680
Even if you overcome

22:01.680 --> 22:02.790
all these difficulties

22:02.790 --> 22:04.790
and get the goods transported to India,

22:04.790 --> 22:05.590
let me ask you:

22:05.630 --> 22:07.030
where will be your warehouse?

22:07.030 --> 22:08.590
Where will be your headquarters?

22:08.590 --> 22:09.590
Where will be your branch stores?

22:09.590 --> 22:11.480
Who will be the manager
and who will be the staff?

22:11.480 --> 22:14.140
You'll be completely in the dark.

22:14.510 --> 22:16.040
Who will you sell to, buddy?

22:17.650 --> 22:19.080
Also, tea and silk

22:19.110 --> 22:20.510
are both perishable.

22:20.750 --> 22:21.640
At most, you'd have

22:21.640 --> 22:23.320
only 2 or 3 months to sell them.

22:23.510 --> 22:25.370
Tea ages, and silk deteriorates.

22:25.510 --> 22:26.480
One small mistake

22:26.480 --> 22:28.210
and you could lose everything.

22:30.640 --> 22:31.240
Madam.

22:32.070 --> 22:33.070
You don't understand.

22:33.070 --> 22:33.830
Of course I understand.

22:33.830 --> 22:34.290
Well...

22:34.510 --> 22:36.240
His plan is to send a warning shot,

22:36.240 --> 22:37.480
forcing the East India Company

22:37.480 --> 22:38.830
to return the salt field ownership

22:38.830 --> 22:40.350
they took.

22:41.030 --> 22:42.160
But the question is,

22:42.240 --> 22:45.440
can you really achieve that
by following the same method?

22:56.960 --> 22:57.870
This place

22:58.000 --> 23:00.440
doesn't look like a merchant's residence.

23:04.070 --> 23:06.270
Before my father became a businessman,

23:06.350 --> 23:07.610
he used to be a scholar.

23:09.720 --> 23:12.200
So why didn't he become an official?

23:13.030 --> 23:14.070
Don't all Chinese people

23:14.070 --> 23:17.070
want to take the imperial exams
and become officials?

23:20.340 --> 23:21.110
It was because he felt that

23:21.110 --> 23:23.510
holding an official position was useless.

23:25.750 --> 23:27.810
Because the once-proud Qing Dynasty

23:28.920 --> 23:30.380
had already come to an end.

23:34.110 --> 23:34.750
Young Master,

23:34.750 --> 23:35.550
they're here.

24:17.350 --> 24:19.080
My respects, Your Excellency.

24:21.700 --> 24:22.350
Li Qin.

24:23.160 --> 24:24.830
I'm here on imperial order to
raid your house.

24:24.830 --> 24:26.030
Are you aware of that?

24:26.790 --> 24:29.310
Please elaborate, Your Excellency.

24:32.270 --> 24:33.510
You mortgaged the salt field title deeds

24:33.510 --> 24:35.160
to Xianghe Trade House,

24:35.480 --> 24:37.880
severely damaging Liangjiang's economy.

24:37.920 --> 24:40.520
I went to the capital
to offer a humble apology,

24:40.890 --> 24:42.950
but the Empress Dowager was furious.

24:43.720 --> 24:44.830
In my opinion,
although you and your father

24:44.830 --> 24:46.960
both bought your official positions,

24:47.640 --> 24:49.960
you're after all
subjects of the Qing Dynasty.

24:49.960 --> 24:51.640
If you repent now,

24:52.000 --> 24:53.330
we can still negotiate.

24:53.750 --> 24:54.590
Otherwise,

24:55.240 --> 24:57.200
don't blame me for being ruthless.

25:08.030 --> 25:08.880
You've wanted to raid my house

25:08.880 --> 25:10.480
for a long time, haven't you?

25:11.110 --> 25:12.590
Ever since my father died,

25:13.000 --> 25:14.930
countless people have been eyeing

25:15.720 --> 25:17.120
our Li family's fortune.

25:18.480 --> 25:20.790
According to
the "Great Qing Legal Code,"

25:20.790 --> 25:22.960
I'm also going to have you arrested.

25:24.960 --> 25:25.510
Stand up.

25:27.310 --> 25:28.510
Mr. Li Qin

25:29.270 --> 25:30.830
is now

25:30.960 --> 25:33.110
a partner of Xianghe Trade House.

25:33.270 --> 25:35.350
You have no authority to arrest him.

25:38.640 --> 25:39.200
This

25:40.070 --> 25:41.510
is the identity certificate

25:41.510 --> 25:43.480
our envoy issued for him.

26:00.830 --> 26:01.510
Li Qin.

26:02.550 --> 26:05.010
Are you even abandoning
your ancestors now?

26:22.400 --> 26:23.530
I have no ancestors.

26:24.920 --> 26:25.520
Nonsense!

26:25.750 --> 26:27.640
Did you spring from a rock?

26:27.720 --> 26:29.110
What do you mean you have no ancestors?

26:29.110 --> 26:30.040
Utter nonsense!

26:31.480 --> 26:33.160
Do you expect me to acknowledge

26:33.160 --> 26:35.490
those people surnamed Gu as my ancestors?

26:38.030 --> 26:39.400
I don't even know if my father's surname

26:39.400 --> 26:40.960
was Li or Gu.

26:44.310 --> 26:45.270
No one ever told me

26:45.270 --> 26:46.600
where they were buried,

26:48.070 --> 26:50.330
and I have no idea who they actually were.

26:53.070 --> 26:54.590
After my father died,

26:56.240 --> 26:58.440
I suddenly realized that in this world,

26:59.270 --> 27:01.070
I'm actually completely alone.

27:03.400 --> 27:04.790
So save your breath.

27:13.640 --> 27:14.350
Are you sure

27:15.640 --> 27:17.300
you don't want to reconsider?

27:21.550 --> 27:23.880
You've said everything you needed to say.

27:24.920 --> 27:25.510
Let's go.

27:33.330 --> 27:34.730
Confiscate everything!

27:39.110 --> 27:41.590
What a fine and virtuous person
you once were—

27:41.590 --> 27:43.310
how did you end up a traitor?

28:03.680 --> 28:05.250
Such a wonderful home,

28:05.590 --> 28:06.550
gone like that.

28:08.030 --> 28:09.750
My home was long gone—

28:12.200 --> 28:12.920
back when my father

28:12.920 --> 28:14.550
lied to me.

28:15.960 --> 28:17.360
For the rest of my life...

28:19.350 --> 28:20.400
For the rest of my life,

28:20.400 --> 28:22.130
I want to be a different person.

28:22.790 --> 28:23.350
Li,

28:24.200 --> 28:26.400
come and join the East India Company.

28:27.110 --> 28:27.960
In 6 months,

28:28.160 --> 28:29.560
you'll be able to control

28:29.680 --> 28:32.350
the Qing Dynasty's
most important industry.

28:33.160 --> 28:35.160
You can buy a even better house then.

28:37.720 --> 28:38.780
Can you really win?

28:39.550 --> 28:40.720
That buddy of mine

28:42.440 --> 28:43.700
is extremely cunning.

28:47.030 --> 28:49.240
It's useless to be cunning.

28:50.350 --> 28:53.000
In business, we don't rely on
cunning—

28:53.440 --> 28:54.570
we rely on strength,

28:55.240 --> 28:56.400
and on cannons.

28:57.720 --> 28:58.680
Could your buddy

28:58.880 --> 29:00.720
be even more powerful than

29:00.720 --> 29:02.050
the East India Company?

29:22.690 --> 29:25.900
[Hangzhou]

29:27.240 --> 29:27.920
Mr. Gu!

29:32.070 --> 29:32.510
Here.

29:34.550 --> 29:36.750
I've been hearing so much about you lately

29:36.750 --> 29:38.950
that my ears are nearly deaf from it all.

29:39.160 --> 29:39.790
Well, we businessmen

29:39.790 --> 29:41.200
pray to the God of Wealth every day.

29:41.200 --> 29:43.270
If that caused deafness,
I'd be deaf long ago.

29:43.270 --> 29:45.130
Come on, let me show you the goods.

29:49.640 --> 29:50.900
Please come in, Mr. Gu.

29:51.440 --> 29:52.000
Open it.

29:58.030 --> 30:00.030
Let's take a look at the goods first.

30:08.400 --> 30:09.410
This is simply...

30:11.240 --> 30:12.240
What do you think?

30:15.070 --> 30:15.790
I've always considered myself

30:15.790 --> 30:17.920
someone who has seen fine embroidery.

30:18.310 --> 30:20.510
But after seeing your goods, I realized

30:20.720 --> 30:21.510
everything I'd seen before

30:21.510 --> 30:22.510
was just garbage.

30:24.870 --> 30:26.520
The embroidery from Huizhou

30:26.920 --> 30:28.320
is certainly quite good.

30:29.400 --> 30:30.200
However,

30:30.270 --> 30:31.640
compared to the embroidery
from Hangzhou and Suzhou,

30:31.640 --> 30:32.440
it definitely

30:33.070 --> 30:34.440
can't match up.

30:35.810 --> 30:37.740
Also, check out our embroiderers.

30:37.960 --> 30:40.360
They've all served in the imperial palace.

30:41.030 --> 30:42.030
Since childhood,

30:42.190 --> 30:44.080
apart from using chopsticks,

30:44.160 --> 30:45.880
they've never done any other manual work

30:45.880 --> 30:46.880
with their hands.

30:47.270 --> 30:47.960
Why is that?

30:51.510 --> 30:53.110
You see, these hands of ours,

30:53.680 --> 30:55.930
if they do even a bit of rough work,

30:56.240 --> 30:58.570
they lose their smoothness and softness.

30:59.350 --> 31:00.690
Our embroiderers here

31:00.740 --> 31:02.310
have learned embroidery since childhood

31:02.310 --> 31:04.270
and have been waited on hand and foot.

31:04.270 --> 31:05.470
To be honest with you,

31:05.510 --> 31:08.840
they use the finest wax
to take care of their hands every day.

31:11.390 --> 31:13.250
Only this way can they work on silk

31:13.590 --> 31:15.960
with thousands upon thousands of stitches

31:15.960 --> 31:17.470
without leaving any trace

31:17.790 --> 31:19.470
or causing

31:19.550 --> 31:21.350
any pilling on the silk surface.

31:21.510 --> 31:22.270
These are all

31:22.270 --> 31:23.800
big secrets of our silk industry.

31:23.800 --> 31:24.550
I'm only telling you this

31:24.550 --> 31:26.750
because you aren't in this line of work.

31:27.830 --> 31:28.630
God of Wealth,

31:29.060 --> 31:29.880
you've truly mastered

31:29.880 --> 31:31.010
the art of business.

31:31.240 --> 31:31.840
Unlike me,

31:32.150 --> 31:33.880
biting off more than I can chew.

31:34.550 --> 31:35.280
Come on, sit.

31:36.440 --> 31:37.440
You may leave now.

31:45.270 --> 31:46.310
I heard

31:46.640 --> 31:48.770
something big happened in Jiangning,

31:48.960 --> 31:52.360
that you've gotten into a conflict
with Xianghe Trade House?

31:53.350 --> 31:54.920
I heard that you, God of Wealth,

31:54.920 --> 31:58.120
have business dealings
with Xianghe Trade House, right?

32:00.590 --> 32:02.530
In the silk business,

32:02.590 --> 32:03.720
Xianghe Trade House

32:04.160 --> 32:04.880
is indeed my

32:04.920 --> 32:06.200
biggest competitor.

32:07.350 --> 32:09.210
That Richard is a cunning old fox.

32:09.310 --> 32:11.110
You may not be able to outwit him.

32:12.550 --> 32:14.310
Even if I can't, I still have to fight.

32:14.310 --> 32:15.640
Those foreigners are trying

32:15.640 --> 32:18.200
to monopolize the entire salt industry
of Lianghuai.

32:18.200 --> 32:19.000
God of Wealth,

32:19.510 --> 32:20.410
no matter what,

32:20.790 --> 32:22.080
you must lend me a hand.

32:26.880 --> 32:29.680
Our two families
have been competing for decades.

32:29.890 --> 32:31.020
Tell me,

32:31.240 --> 32:32.920
what good strategy do you have in mind?

32:32.920 --> 32:34.160
If it's truly workable,

32:34.160 --> 32:36.690
I'd certainly be happy to
enjoy the benefits.

32:37.720 --> 32:38.710
I want to know

32:39.270 --> 32:40.400
if the Xianghe Trade House

32:40.400 --> 32:41.830
is the East India Company's

32:41.830 --> 32:42.510
only institution

32:42.510 --> 32:44.240
stationed in our Qing Dynasty?

32:44.960 --> 32:46.110
Of course not.

32:46.880 --> 32:48.240
So is the East India Company

32:48.240 --> 32:49.200
the only

32:49.440 --> 32:51.570
British commercial company in India?

32:52.200 --> 32:53.480
No, this East India Company

32:53.480 --> 32:54.720
is just one of them.

32:54.830 --> 32:56.590
But in terms of scale,

32:57.070 --> 32:58.470
it is indeed the largest.

33:01.070 --> 33:03.030
I don't need the scale to be very large.

33:03.030 --> 33:04.290
Actually, this method

33:04.350 --> 33:07.790
is something I learned from
the "Strategies of the Warring States."

33:07.790 --> 33:09.080
It can help you, Mr. Wu,

33:09.160 --> 33:10.760
sweep away your competitor.

33:12.350 --> 33:13.880
What do you mean by that?

33:15.030 --> 33:16.290
I need the finest goods

33:16.350 --> 33:17.610
you have in your stock.

33:18.070 --> 33:18.920
That's easy.

33:19.000 --> 33:20.700
Just tell me what you want

33:20.830 --> 33:22.000
and where you want it shipped.

33:22.000 --> 33:24.060
I'll hire a ship to deliver it for you.

33:24.640 --> 33:26.240
We can't use ordinary ships.

33:26.480 --> 33:28.240
I want to contact a British company

33:28.240 --> 33:29.750
and use the foreigners' ships

33:29.750 --> 33:30.790
to transport the goods to India,

33:30.790 --> 33:32.390
or even directly to Britain.

33:32.760 --> 33:33.550
I also need you

33:33.550 --> 33:35.010
to come with me to Shanghai

33:35.480 --> 33:37.920
to meet Mr. Hart from the Customs Office.

33:38.510 --> 33:39.790
I plan to set sail westward

33:39.790 --> 33:42.590
and use
the "Besiege Wei to rescue Zhao" strategy.

33:42.880 --> 33:45.160
I'm afraid I won't be able to
rent such ships.

33:45.160 --> 33:47.590
Someone else will help me rent them.

33:48.440 --> 33:48.960
I know

33:48.960 --> 33:50.480
you're on good terms with Mr. Hart,

33:50.480 --> 33:51.240
so I must

33:51.240 --> 33:52.510
take you with me.

33:58.030 --> 33:58.590
Buddy.

34:00.000 --> 34:01.000
Do you really mean

34:02.510 --> 34:04.030
your words?

34:04.920 --> 34:06.380
I've made a solemn pledge.

34:07.400 --> 34:08.800
This is no joking matter.

34:09.580 --> 34:14.130
[Hart's Residence, Shanghai]

34:10.510 --> 34:12.190
I expected you'd come,

34:12.230 --> 34:13.920
but I didn't expect it to be this late.

34:13.920 --> 34:14.520
Is that so?

34:14.920 --> 34:16.110
I wasn't referring to you.

34:16.110 --> 34:17.639
I didn't expect you to come.

34:17.840 --> 34:18.969
But it was only right

34:19.030 --> 34:19.840
that he came.

34:21.400 --> 34:22.800
I'm taking the blame for someone else.

34:22.800 --> 34:23.659
I had to come.

34:23.760 --> 34:25.420
This mess has gotten serious.

34:25.570 --> 34:27.840
I've received an imperial edict
these past days.

34:27.840 --> 34:29.150
The Empress Dowager

34:29.150 --> 34:30.550
has strictly ordered
the Viceroy of Liangjiang

34:30.550 --> 34:32.110
to reclaim the salt fields.

34:32.150 --> 34:33.550
What on earth is going on with you guys?

34:33.550 --> 34:35.810
You've provoked the East India Company?

34:37.230 --> 34:38.889
I'll put in a good word for you.

34:39.550 --> 34:40.610
Business like this

34:40.670 --> 34:41.550
can't be done

34:41.550 --> 34:43.010
through personal favors.

34:44.150 --> 34:45.949
If I were the East India Company,

34:46.150 --> 34:48.210
it wouldn't matter who came begging.

34:49.360 --> 34:50.400
Did you receive the information,

34:50.400 --> 34:52.480
or did you figure this out on your own?

34:53.550 --> 34:55.440
Sir, you've already
gone to negotiate with them, haven't you?

34:55.440 --> 34:56.710
As soon as I received the edict,

34:56.710 --> 34:57.630
I went to negotiate,

34:57.630 --> 34:58.690
but it didn't work.

34:59.510 --> 35:00.510
Apart from opium,

35:00.550 --> 35:02.350
it seems that the Chinese market

35:02.710 --> 35:05.110
isn't welcoming to British goods.

35:08.070 --> 35:09.070
Your Excellency.

35:12.280 --> 35:13.150
Greetings, Your Excellency.

35:13.150 --> 35:14.750
Come sit here and let's talk.

35:19.880 --> 35:20.680
Let me ask you:

35:21.280 --> 35:22.590
how many salt shops

35:22.590 --> 35:23.760
does your

35:23.760 --> 35:25.510
Salt Industry Guild currently control?

35:25.510 --> 35:27.480
In response to your question,
Your Excellency,

35:27.480 --> 35:28.630
including the newly opened

35:28.630 --> 35:30.040
117 shops,

35:30.110 --> 35:32.550
there's a total of 305.

35:32.800 --> 35:34.650
With these 305 shops,

35:34.960 --> 35:35.670
not counting

35:35.670 --> 35:38.360
the money you've invested in
newly opened shops,

35:38.360 --> 35:40.360
at your most profitable time,

35:40.360 --> 35:42.490
could you make 10 million taels a year?

35:45.590 --> 35:46.990
Not that much, I suppose.

35:47.320 --> 35:49.600
By my estimate, it's only about

35:49.710 --> 35:50.640
9 million taels,

35:51.000 --> 35:52.460
with little fluctuation.

35:52.510 --> 35:54.230
The point is this is just gross profit.

35:54.230 --> 35:54.550
It's...

35:54.550 --> 35:55.880
That's not right.

35:57.030 --> 35:58.030
What's not right?

35:58.880 --> 36:00.690
Your boss Mr. Gu

36:00.880 --> 36:02.150
has been making big moves recently.

36:02.150 --> 36:03.680
Didn't you know about that?

36:05.360 --> 36:06.490
Are you referring to

36:07.000 --> 36:09.590
Mr. Gu going to Anhui to collect tea?

36:10.480 --> 36:12.680
It's far more than just tea collection.

36:12.840 --> 36:14.360
Silk, medicine—

36:14.440 --> 36:15.960
he's dealing in everything now.

36:15.960 --> 36:16.960
Besides,

36:17.320 --> 36:19.190
he's now openly saying

36:19.190 --> 36:21.720
he's going to ship a batch of goods
to Britain.

36:23.920 --> 36:25.320
I want to contact a British company

36:25.320 --> 36:26.440
that competes with

36:26.440 --> 36:28.000
the East India Company

36:29.070 --> 36:30.280
and partner with them

36:30.480 --> 36:31.760
in tea, silk, medicine

36:31.760 --> 36:32.880
and other businesses.

36:32.880 --> 36:34.230
I'll have this British company

36:34.230 --> 36:35.190
handle my sales,

36:35.400 --> 36:37.760
and I'll be the supplier
allocating the goods.

36:37.760 --> 36:38.620
I can guarantee

36:38.960 --> 36:40.420
that all goods from my side

36:40.800 --> 36:42.150
are of the highest quality,

36:42.150 --> 36:44.150
and I can guarantee to
procure it at the lowest price.

36:44.150 --> 36:44.800
If we can

36:44.800 --> 36:45.840
carve out a market of our own

36:45.840 --> 36:47.360
within every commercial sector

36:47.360 --> 36:49.090
the East India Company covers,

36:49.320 --> 36:50.110
we can force them

36:50.110 --> 36:51.440
to come and negotiate with us.

36:51.440 --> 36:52.400
With a monster like this—

36:52.400 --> 36:53.530
a commercial giant—

36:53.630 --> 36:54.760
gentle persuasion is useless.

36:54.760 --> 36:56.000
You have to make them scared,

36:56.000 --> 36:57.360
make them feel threatened.

36:57.360 --> 36:59.090
I've made a rough calculation.

36:59.480 --> 37:01.320
The cost of this shipment of goods

37:01.320 --> 37:02.250
is equivalent to

37:02.760 --> 37:04.400
what your Salt Industry Guild

37:04.400 --> 37:05.480
makes in 3 years.

37:06.320 --> 37:08.320
Where is he getting that money from?

37:09.190 --> 37:10.520
You're producing salt,

37:11.000 --> 37:12.550
not mining gold.

37:14.000 --> 37:15.000
Your Excellency.

37:15.480 --> 37:16.440
I've also

37:16.510 --> 37:18.170
caught some rumors out there.

37:18.190 --> 37:19.320
Some friends of his

37:19.660 --> 37:20.940
gave him the goods

37:21.190 --> 37:22.850
but didn't collect the money—

37:22.880 --> 37:25.190
said they'd settle it
after the goods are sold...

37:25.190 --> 37:26.920
If this batch of goods
were to be transported

37:26.920 --> 37:28.480
from Shanxi to Shandong,

37:28.960 --> 37:31.290
I could understand delaying the payment.

37:31.590 --> 37:33.320
With Mr. Gu reputation,

37:33.400 --> 37:34.800
it wouldn't be a problem.

37:35.840 --> 37:38.300
But this is going overseas
across the ocean.

37:38.510 --> 37:40.710
This is a completely different matter.

37:43.440 --> 37:45.440
I have something to instruct you on.

37:47.150 --> 37:48.150
Your Excellency,

37:48.150 --> 37:49.230
please give your instructions.

37:49.230 --> 37:51.160
I did ask him to compete with Li Qin,

37:51.670 --> 37:52.840
but I never expected

37:53.150 --> 37:54.320
he would go this far.

37:54.960 --> 37:56.590
Our Qing Dynasty has its
official factories

37:56.590 --> 37:58.280
and the Office of General Management.

37:58.280 --> 37:59.590
Who does he think he is,

37:59.710 --> 38:00.970
selling goods abroad?

38:02.230 --> 38:04.200
If we let him set this precedent,

38:04.550 --> 38:05.840
will the laws of the Qing Dynasty

38:05.840 --> 38:07.320
have to be rewritten?

38:09.710 --> 38:11.710
You're all experienced and mature.

38:12.030 --> 38:13.830
Don't follow his reckless path.

38:14.760 --> 38:16.480
Keep the Salt Industry Guild

38:16.480 --> 38:17.610
in good order for me.

38:18.670 --> 38:19.750
Do you know

38:19.880 --> 38:20.920
why the East India Company

38:20.920 --> 38:22.030
has become

38:22.030 --> 38:22.800
so powerful?

38:23.110 --> 38:24.030
Look down there.

38:24.030 --> 38:25.550
All the merchant ships on this river

38:25.550 --> 38:26.410
belong to them.

38:26.630 --> 38:28.590
May I ask how you plan

38:28.590 --> 38:30.190
to transport your goods to India,

38:30.190 --> 38:31.360
or even to Britain?

38:32.400 --> 38:33.460
I'll use warships.

38:34.030 --> 38:35.230
British warships?

38:35.920 --> 38:36.760
I have my way.

38:37.280 --> 38:38.400
My transportation costs

38:38.400 --> 38:40.200
will be lower than all of theirs.

38:41.150 --> 38:42.800
Then let me ask you another question.

38:42.800 --> 38:44.800
The East India Company
has been doing business

38:44.800 --> 38:46.190
with the Qing Dynasty for years.

38:46.190 --> 38:47.360
I believe the goods they acquire

38:47.360 --> 38:48.630
come at

38:48.760 --> 38:50.510
extremely low prices.

38:51.110 --> 38:53.510
So what advantage do you have
against them?

38:55.230 --> 38:56.020
I have contact with

38:56.020 --> 38:57.670
all the tea merchants in Anhui,

38:57.670 --> 38:58.480
the finest silk

38:58.480 --> 39:00.510
and raw silk in the Liangjiang region,

39:00.510 --> 39:02.230
and medicinal herbs from Shanxi,

39:02.230 --> 39:04.360
things like rhubarb and goji berries.

39:04.360 --> 39:05.710
I can procure all of these goods

39:05.710 --> 39:07.110
at the lowest prices,

39:07.400 --> 39:08.730
ensuring ample profit.

39:10.920 --> 39:12.110
The lowest prices?

39:13.070 --> 39:14.800
Can you really guarantee that?

39:15.920 --> 39:18.120
Merchants do seek profit, that's true.

39:18.320 --> 39:19.150
But this time,

39:19.630 --> 39:20.880
I don't want any profit,

39:20.880 --> 39:22.440
nor do my friends.

39:23.030 --> 39:24.280
Though our Qing Dynasty is weak,

39:24.280 --> 39:25.400
we must never let others

39:25.400 --> 39:26.730
control our lifelines.

39:33.320 --> 39:34.480
It simply means that this year,

39:34.480 --> 39:36.590
our silk business in Jiangnan

39:37.360 --> 39:38.800
will operate without profit.

39:38.800 --> 39:40.110
I can guarantee this.

39:40.840 --> 39:42.100
What about the others?

39:42.360 --> 39:44.630
Do the tea and medicine merchants

39:44.630 --> 39:45.960
also think the same way?

39:46.480 --> 39:47.110
Mr. Hart.

39:48.400 --> 39:49.920
Don't underestimate us

39:50.160 --> 39:51.670
unarmed merchants.

39:52.440 --> 39:53.700
In the way of commerce,

39:53.960 --> 39:55.510
petty schemes serve oneself,

39:55.510 --> 39:57.420
but great strategies serve the nation.

39:57.420 --> 39:58.880
Even in business battles,

39:59.110 --> 40:01.040
one can still serve their country.

40:05.630 --> 40:06.760
What does this mean?

40:06.920 --> 40:08.370
Are these merchants really going to

40:08.370 --> 40:09.110
join forces

40:09.110 --> 40:10.740
t-to defeat that guy?

40:12.230 --> 40:14.070
Whether they'll defeat him or not

40:14.070 --> 40:15.200
is still uncertain.

40:15.760 --> 40:18.090
But at the very least,
we must let them know

40:18.110 --> 40:19.570
that we Chinese merchants

40:20.000 --> 40:21.230
can make money

40:21.880 --> 40:23.540
even without using gunboats.

40:51.670 --> 40:53.070
Thank goodness we got out.

40:53.070 --> 40:53.670
It felt like hell

40:53.670 --> 40:54.840
in there.

40:56.480 --> 40:57.480
Those foreigners

40:57.480 --> 40:59.000
aren't used to our opera.

40:59.440 --> 41:00.440
All that clang clang clang—

41:00.440 --> 41:02.370
they think the gongs are too noisy.

41:06.550 --> 41:07.350
Let me ask you.

41:08.320 --> 41:10.280
Are you doing this out of spite,

41:10.280 --> 41:11.370
or are you serious?

41:12.550 --> 41:13.880
What do you mean by that?

41:15.880 --> 41:17.920
If you're just doing this out of spite,

41:17.920 --> 41:19.360
we can work together

41:19.510 --> 41:21.320
to scare this East India Company

41:21.320 --> 41:23.120
into retreating, and that's it.

41:23.880 --> 41:25.630
People travel far for profit.

41:25.880 --> 41:27.840
No one truly wants to make enemies.

41:28.590 --> 41:30.250
But if you're serious,

41:30.960 --> 41:32.160
then it's dangerous.

41:32.920 --> 41:34.360
This is something that's never happened

41:34.360 --> 41:35.590
in 3,000 years.

41:39.150 --> 41:40.150
What if I tell you

41:41.480 --> 41:42.480
that I am serious?

41:44.320 --> 41:46.110
Stop joking.

41:48.590 --> 41:51.320
You're not actually
planning to do this, are you?

41:52.030 --> 41:53.230
This is the Qing Dynasty,

41:53.230 --> 41:54.190
not England.

41:54.440 --> 41:55.320
If you really get a ship

41:55.320 --> 41:56.360
and transport the goods overseas,

41:56.360 --> 41:57.710
where does that leave the imperial court?

41:57.710 --> 41:58.480
The "Great Qing Legal Code"

41:58.480 --> 41:59.940
has no provision for this.

42:02.070 --> 42:02.710
Mr. Wu.

42:04.710 --> 42:06.000
I have something I want to say,

42:06.000 --> 42:07.530
but I'm not sure if I should.

42:08.150 --> 42:08.590
Go on.

42:08.760 --> 42:09.590
I'm all ears.

42:11.070 --> 42:12.840
I think the problem is that our country

42:12.840 --> 42:14.500
has had emperors for too long.

42:16.150 --> 42:17.540
Don't talk nonsense.

42:18.110 --> 42:19.040
This kind of talk

42:19.760 --> 42:21.160
could cost you your head.

42:21.730 --> 42:23.390
Look at the ships on the river.

42:25.070 --> 42:26.070
These foreigners

42:26.230 --> 42:28.230
brought cannons and gunpowder here

42:28.590 --> 42:30.650
to protect their country's business

42:31.230 --> 42:33.190
and mobilized their entire national army

42:33.190 --> 42:34.790
to protect their merchants,

42:35.190 --> 42:37.190
determined to sell their goods

42:37.250 --> 42:38.400
to our country

42:38.440 --> 42:40.150
and seize our domestic market.

42:40.150 --> 42:41.920
I believe that
when these merchants come in,

42:41.920 --> 42:43.380
the influence behind them

42:43.550 --> 42:44.710
far surpasses

42:44.710 --> 42:45.840
the power of an army.

42:48.030 --> 42:49.290
In the way of commerce,

42:49.480 --> 42:51.480
great strategies serve the nation.

42:51.800 --> 42:54.060
We have to find a way
to compete with them.

42:54.190 --> 42:55.400
It would be best to go to their countries

42:55.400 --> 42:56.480
and do business there.

42:56.480 --> 42:57.740
Let people make full use of
their abilities,

42:57.740 --> 42:59.590
and let goods flow to
where they're needed.

42:59.590 --> 43:01.050
Perhaps only by doing this

43:01.510 --> 43:02.320
can we find

43:02.320 --> 43:03.110
a way out.
